+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-enable = Enable Russian PKI support
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-enable-failed = Russian PKI support could not be changed. The setting is unchanged.
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-enabled-state = Russian PKI support is enabled. Russian PKI trust is limited to the isolated Good Bear container.
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-disabled-state = Russian PKI support is disabled. Assigned sites use normal Firefox certificate validation.
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-sites-header = Russian PKI sites
