+    .aria-label = Assigned Russian PKI sites
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-sites-empty = No Russian PKI sites are assigned.
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-reset-origin = Remove { $origin }
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-reset-origin-confirmation = Remove the Russian PKI assignment for { $origin } and its local trust-source history? The site will be classified again on its next visit.
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-reset-all = Clear all site assignments…
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-reset-all-confirmation = Clear all Russian PKI site assignments and their local trust-source history? Sites will be classified again on their next visit.
