+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-reset-failed = The assignment list could not be changed. Current isolation is preserved.
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-credentials-header = Credentials
+goodbear-russian-pki-settings-credentials-description = Saving and autofilling passwords, addresses and payment data are disabled in the Russian PKI container. No credentials are displayed here.
